<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$85 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$85 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market absorbed a total of A$85 million worth of promissory notes sold at tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>General Property Trust lead issuance totals for the second day in a row, selling A$50 million of its early January-dated paper at about 4.5 basis points over the corresponding bank bill mid rate.</p>
